    "expectedRule": "Chapter 10 entropy runs 0-4 and starts at 2. The first clear of a monster or trap (not the last_helmsman boss) raises it by 1 and the first clear of a reward lowers it by 1, clamped; the first clear of a heading console (bow, midship, stern) instead leaves a pending heading that blocks leaving with `方舟航向尚未指定，请先选择稳航或抢航。` until law/resolve-entropy-heading picks steady (-1) or rush (+1); with nothing pending a heading is refused with `当前没有待指定的方舟航向。`. Display: title 方舟航态, status `熵值 n/4`, `熵值 n/4，待选航` or, once locked, `熵值 n/4，已锁定，崩解层 k`; meter {n, 4}; resolved (targetReached) only at 2 with nothing pending and no collapse layer, danger at 0, 4 or two layers, otherwise warning. Modifiers: at entropy <= 1 enemy defense +(2-n)x10% and trap damage/DC -(2-n)x10%; at entropy >= 3 trap damage/DC, non-boss enemy all stats and outgoing force/art damage +(n-2)x10%; in the boss encounter enemy all stats are +10% per collapse layer instead. Selecting the boss locks entropy and sets collapseLayers = clamp(|n - 2| - ark_keel_boots, 0, 2). With mist_breathing as the main method every trap is seen through, so a risked trap deals max(4, floor(damage x 0.45)): port_pressure_lock 94 at entropy 0 -> ceil(75.2) = 76 -> 34. Run pressure stays 0% below 6 clears. Gates: ark_bow_port_relic_lane needs entropy >= 3, ark_bow_dissipation_lane entropy <= 1 (closed: `艏部消散航道仅在熵值 1 或以下开放。`), ark_manifest_helmsman_lane entropy 1-3 (closed: `方舟显化需熵值维持在 1 至 3 之间。`). The pursuer is a separate run system and is disabled after entry so it cannot ambush the walk. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
